      "text": "t.cells = calloc(16,1) → a SECOND empty board. New states are written there,\nso the old board stays intact while we read it — decisions never mix old & new.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "t.cells = calloc(16,1) → a SECOND empty board. New states are written there,\nso the old board stays intact while we read it — decisions never mix old & new.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b5S"
    },
    {
      "id": "el0402",
      "type": "text",
